{"vid":"1PLjWUH_4kQ","source":"1PLjWUH_4kQ.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.5,"txt":"Hi, I'm Stephanie."},{"t":1.6,"txt":"And I'm Joe with AWS. And today we're"},{"t":3.7,"txt":"going to talk about the recommended PPE."},{"t":6.1,"txt":"For any welding and cutting processes."},{"t":25.4,"txt":"Up first, the welding helmet, also known"},{"t":27.9,"txt":"as the hood. There's really two"},{"t":29.6,"txt":"different styles, the fixed shade and"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"the auto darkening."},{"t":33.1,"txt":"I myself I prefer a passive lens or a"},{"t":35.5,"txt":"fixed shade. You swap out the lenses as"},{"t":38,"txt":"needed for the style or type of welding"},{"t":40.2,"txt":"you're doing."},{"t":41.1,"txt":"And I like the auto darkening hood. I"},{"t":43.4,"txt":"really like this hood because I'm able"},{"t":44.9,"txt":"to go from grinding to welding at higher"},{"t":48.2,"txt":"amperages with with MIG welding or lower"},{"t":50.2,"txt":"amperages with TIG welding, all just by"},{"t":51.9,"txt":"adjusting my settings."},{"t":53.3,"txt":"Safety glasses. Eye protection is super"},{"t":55.9,"txt":"important. Make sure you always wear"},{"t":58,"txt":"your safety glasses underneath your"},{"t":59.8,"txt":"helmet while you're welding to keep"},{"t":61.4,"txt":"sparks and foreign debris out of your"},{"t":63.3,"txt":"eyes."},{"t":63.9,"txt":"Now, let's be honest, safety glasses"},{"t":66,"txt":"should always be worn anytime you're in"},{"t":67.8,"txt":"a working shop."},{"t":69,"txt":"When I weld, I do a lot of out of"},{"t":70.6,"txt":"position welding with the shielded metal"},{"t":72.4,"txt":"arc welding process or flux core. So"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"having a welder's beanie is really"},{"t":76.4,"txt":"handy. One, it keeps the sparks out of"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"my hair and most importantly, the bill"},{"t":81.4,"txt":"keeps the sparks out of my ear. So"},{"t":83,"txt":"that's why I wear it."},{"t":84.1,"txt":"For me, I don't do a lot of out of"},{"t":85.4,"txt":"position welding like Joe does and most"},{"t":87.2,"txt":"of the stuff that I do is TIG welding."},{"t":89.1,"txt":"But one thing I always make sure I have"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"done is my hair tied back so I'm safe."},{"t":94.2,"txt":"Ear protection is an essential safety"},{"t":95.7,"txt":"element for any welder, protecting the"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"welder from excessive noise along with"},{"t":99.1,"txt":"hot sparks from entering the ear canal."},{"t":101.1,"txt":"To protect against a variety of gases,"},{"t":103.4,"txt":"vapors, and particulate hazards, a"},{"t":105.7,"txt":"respirator is recommended while welding."},{"t":109,"txt":"Whenever we weld, we always want to have"},{"t":110.7,"txt":"a good pair of gloves."},{"t":112.6,"txt":"The gloves are going to protect our"},{"t":114.1,"txt":"hands from the heat, the arc, UV light,"},{"t":117.2,"txt":"sparks, and sharp edges of material when"},{"t":119.7,"txt":"we're handling it."},{"t":121,"txt":"When welding or cutting, your gloves are"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"going to fall into two categories. For"},{"t":124.6,"txt":"MIG welding and stick welding, you're"},{"t":125.9,"txt":"going to have a heavier leather glove."},{"t":128.1,"txt":"When TIG welding, you're going to have a"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"thinner leather glove."},{"t":131.4,"txt":"Last but not least, let's talk about"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"flame resistant clothing. This includes"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"a jacket, a shirt, pants, and your"},{"t":138.5,"txt":"footwear."},{"t":139.6,"txt":"There are many different variations and"},{"t":141,"txt":"styles of flame resistant clothing. And"},{"t":143.2,"txt":"what you wear is going to be determined"},{"t":144.8,"txt":"upon the welding application that you're"},{"t":146.7,"txt":"using. Now, one thing that's really"},{"t":148.4,"txt":"important to remember is that all of"},{"t":150.3,"txt":"your PPE and flame resistant clothing is"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"free of any tears, holes, or cuffs."},{"t":156,"txt":"Well, Joe, it's time to"},{"t":158.7,"txt"